# Arabelle as the Tarokka's ally (the Tempter: "somewhere on Lake Zarovich, in danger"). Her rescue from Bluto is
# Vallaki's (vistani_camp.dialogue); this is the join. Once Bluto's business at the landing is settled, she is
# found drifting off the end of the jetty in a boat that has slipped its rope, waiting for the party.

~ start
Narrator: Off the end of the jetty, a little boat has slipped its rope and is turning slowly in the mist, a few yards out. In it, sitting very straight with her hands folded in her lap, is Arabelle.
Arabelle: There you are. The rope came undone. I knew it would. I sat in the boat anyway, so you'd know where to find me.
if flag.bluto_fate == "saved"
Arabelle: You stopped the fish-man. I didn't see that. I like being surprised. It hardly ever happens.
elif flag.bluto_fate == "drowned"
Arabelle [sad]: The fish-man went in. I said he would. I didn't want to be right.
endif
if name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Miss, the boat. The boat's drifting into deep water. Could we do the fish later? I'm sure it's fine. It isn't fine.
else
interject tag:blunt: That boat is drifting toward deep water, and she's telling us about fish.
endif
* [Athletics DC 12] Wade out and haul the boat in. -> haul_ok | haul_fail
* Throw her a line. -> line

~ haul_ok
Narrator: The water comes up to your chest and the cold drives the breath out of you, but you get a hand on the bow and walk the boat back to the jetty like a reluctant horse.
-> aboard

~ haul_fail
Narrator: The bottom drops away under you and you go in over your head. You come up spluttering, with the bow rope somehow in your fist, and tow her in while she watches with polite interest.
-> aboard

~ line
Narrator: She catches the rope first time, as though she'd practised, and holds on while you pull. The boat bumps against the jetty.
-> aboard

~ aboard
Arabelle: Papa knows I'm here. He cried. Then he said I was to make you promise to bring me back. So you have to promise.
if flag.arabelle_ribbon_found
Arabelle: You found my ribbon on the post. I tied it there before. Before before.
endif
Arabelle: The cards said I go with you. I saw it before they did. I see the castle, and a staircase, and somebody laughing who shouldn't be.
* We promise. Come with us. -> join
* Arabelle, go home to your father. -> home

~ join
join arabelle
quest find_the_ally found
Arabelle: Good. Somebody has to tell you which way not to go.
if name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Hello again, little lady! You're much drier than last time. Well done.
else
interject tag:cheerful: Hello again. You're much drier than last time.
endif
Arabelle: I'll be wet again later. Not today.
interject class:cleric: We'll keep her behind us, always. Always.
-> END

~ home
set arabelle_sent_home
Arabelle: All right. I'll be at the camp. You'll come and get me there, when you're ready. Papa will cry again. He likes crying more than he says.
approve kip_smudgewick +2 godrick_pendlebrook +1: You sent Arabelle home to her father
-> END
